  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 日本語版「ニオイタコノキ」",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%8B%E3%82%AA%E3%82%A4%E3%82%BF%E3%82%B3%E3%83%8E%E3%82%AD",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 107861055,
      "text": "ニオイタコノキ(Pandanus amaryllifolius)は、タコノキ属の熱帯植物である。パンダン(pandan)として知られる。葉には芳香があり、東南アジアにおいて、料理の香り付けに広く用いられる。また、タミル料理等の南アジアの食文化や中国の海南料理でも用いられる。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 英語版「Pandanus amaryllifolius」",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Pandanus_amaryllifolius",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 1373202840,
      "text": "Pandanus amaryllifolius is a tropical plant in the Pandanus (screwpine) genus, which is commonly known as pandan. Its fragrant leaves are commonly used for flavoring in the cuisines of Southeast Asia, some South Asian cuisines and in Hainanese cuisine from China."
    }
  },
